OL,3,AUS approves sale of 500 Patriot
OL,4,Amissiles to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe United States has approved the sale
OL,7,Fof 500 Patriot missiles to Ukraine, a
OL,8,Fcritically needed munition for defence
OL,9,Fagainst escalating Russian aerial
OL,10,Fattacks.
OL,12,FHowever, Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,13,FZelensky has warned it could take
OL,14,F"several years" for the deliveries to
OL,15,Farrive.
OL,17,FThe US State Department said the
OL,18,Fadvanced PAC-3 interceptor missiles
OL,19,Fwould cost $2.1bn (#1.6bn) and would be
OL,20,F"funded entirely" by Kyiv's allies in
OL,21,FEurope and Canada.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
