OL,3,AUS approves sale of 500 Patriot
OL,4,Amissiles to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday night Zelensky repeated his
OL,7,Fcalls for the US to speed up the
OL,8,Frelease of its Patriots ` the only
OL,9,Feffective weapon for downing Russia's
OL,10,Fdeadly ballistic missiles.
